        },
        {
          "chunk_index": 2,
          "chunk_id": "s01_c02",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s01_c2_icml_2024_vineet_jain_siamak",
          "text": "In this ICML 2024 paper, Vineet Jain and Siamak Ravanbakhsh from McGill University and Mila reframe goal-conditioned reinforcement learning through the lens of denoising diffusion.",
          "expected_role": "content",
          "cue_keywords": [
