          "chunk_index": 4,
          "chunk_id": "s02_c04",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s02_c4_policies_generate_actions_not_presen",
          "text": "Policies generate actions not present in the data, the value estimates for those actions are wrong, and these errors compound over time until the policy diverges. Sparse binary rewards only make the estimation problem harder.",
          "expected_role": "result",
          "cue_keywords": [
            "policies",
