        {
          "chunk_index": 4,
          "chunk_id": "s04_c04",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s04_c4_third_develops_three_ways_construct",
          "text": "Third, it develops three ways to construct the forward, goal-departing trajectories: a fixed heuristic version, a parametric learned forward model called Merlin-P, and a non-parametric version called Merlin-NP that stitches together nearby states in a learned latent space.",
          "expected_role": "method",
          "cue_keywords": [
            "third",
            "develops",
            "three",
            "ways",
            "construct",
