        {
          "chunk_index": 4,
          "chunk_id": "s05_c04",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s05_c4_authors_offer_three_ways_build",
          "text": "The authors offer three ways to build the goal-departing trajectories: a fixed construction, a learned parametric forward model in Merlin-P, and a non-parametric model in Merlin-NP that connects nearby states through nearest-neighbor stitching in a learned latent space.",
          "expected_role": "method",
          "cue_keywords": [
            "authors",
